WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:17.000
No, I can't come out tonight. I'm wrestling with my thoughts. 

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.440
(Knocks) Hold on a second, hun. I'm diddling myself. 

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:25.840
I feel like you really get me...

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.560
...unlike some people in this house!

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.850
Hey, hun. I have something to show you. 

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.000
I think you'll like my shed. 

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.310
Don't talk to Matthew. He's beneath us. 

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.500
This is all I have left of my daddy. 

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:46.240
This is so nice. I can't hear the voices out here. 

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.620
I wish you could see me without this mask on. 

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:52.360
You're missing out on the snack I made us...again. 

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.650
I will always love you. 

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:06.300
In retrospect, I didn't have a great childhood.

